@startuml
title E2EE Demo Workflow

autonumber

actor User
participant Receiver
participant Sender
participant WebSocket as "WebSocket Server"

User -> Receiver: Start
Receiver -> Receiver: generate RSA keypair
Receiver --> Sender: send public key

Sender -> Sender: generate Fernet session key
Sender -> Sender: encrypt plaintext with Fernet
Sender -> Sender: encrypt session key with Receiver public key (RSA-OAEP)
Sender -> WebSocket: send JSON\n{ encrypted_key, encrypted_message }

WebSocket -> Receiver: receive message
Receiver -> Receiver: decrypt_message()
Receiver -> Receiver: decrypt session key with RSA private key
Receiver -> Receiver: decrypt message with Fernet session key
Receiver --> User: print plaintext message

@enduml